<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN CAR REGISTRATIONS UP 3.7% YR/YR IN JAN.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN CAR REGISTRATIONS UP 3.7% YR/YR IN JAN.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian new car registrations</p>
<p>rose 3.7 percent in January compared with the same year ago</p>
<p>period, according to figures from the Belgian Federation of</p>
<p>Automobile Manufacturers (Febiac).</p>
<p>    BELGIAN CAR REGISTRATIONS Jan 97	  Jan 96</p>
<p>    Month			   44,465	  42,873</p>
</text>
